        "content": "Travel & Tourism",
        "type": "heading",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content2": {
        "content": "Travel apps inspire users and help them plan their trips.",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content3": {
        "content": "1. Location Services",
        "type": "sub-heading",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content4": {
        "content": "Use `google_maps_flutter` to show destinations and `geolocator` for user location.",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content5": {
        "content": "2. Booking Systems",
        "type": "sub-heading",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content6": {
        "content": "Implement complex forms for flight and hotel searches. Use date range pickers.",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content7": {
        "content": "3. Itineraries",
        "type": "sub-heading",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content8": {
        "content": "Allow users to save plans offline using a local database like `sqflite` or `hive`.",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content9": {
        "content": "Summary",
        "type": "heading",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content10": {
        "content": "Beautiful imagery and intuitive navigation are key.",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
